{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoPan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an action, horror, and mystery game in which your main objective is to hunt down enemies while exploring the map. As enemies are eliminated, stronger ones appear, each with different characteristics. So, the challenge is to find the best way to eliminate them. There will be traps to make things more difficult, and some locations will require keys to access. There are unknown allies who possess various items and equipment. When you close a deal, you must complete several of their missions to obtain new items and equipment. You can also fulfill the objective of discovering what happened to the villagers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2711770?t=1761933305","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761933305","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711770/e0a419e928af399f56884ff5be167ce552a5588d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761933305","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711770/e0a419e928af399f56884ff5be167ce552a5588d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761933305","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RoPan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an action, horror, and mystery game in which your main objective is to hunt down enemies while exploring the map. As enemies are eliminated, stronger ones appear, each with different characteristics. So, the challenge is to find the best way to eliminate them. There will be traps to make things more difficult, and some locations will require keys to access. There are unknown allies who possess various items and equipment. When you close a deal, you must complete several of their missions to obtain n